 "prompt": "The repository at /testbed has a bug, described below. Fix it by changing the source code; do not modify or\nadd tests. When you are done, the project's existing test suite should pass.\n\n<issue>\nStarred unpacking inference broken in assignments and for loops\n\n#### Description\n\nWhen using starred expressions (`*variable`) in unpacking assignments or for loops, the inference is not working correctly. The starred variable should contain the remaining elements as a list, but instead returns nothing or causes errors.\n\n#### Steps/Code to Reproduce\n\n```python\nimport astroid\n\n# Simple starred unpacking in assignment\ncode1 = \"\"\"\na, *b, c = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\nb\n\"\"\"\nnode1 = astroid.extract_node(code1)\ninferred1 = next(node1.infer())\nprint(f\"Expected: [2, 3, 4], Got: {inferred1}\")\n\n# Starred unpacking with empty result\ncode2 = \"\"\"\na, *b, c = [1, 2]\nb\n\"\"\"\nnode2 = astroid.extract_node(code2)\ninferred2 = next(node2.infer())\nprint(f\"Expected: [], Got: {inferred2}\")\n\n# Starred unpacking in for loop\ncode3 = \"\"\"\nfor a, *b in [(1, 2, 3, 4)]:\n    b\n\"\"\"\nnode3 = astroid.extract_node(code3)\ninferred3 = next(node3.infer())\nprint(f\"Expected: [2, 3, 4], Got: {inferred3}\")\n```\n\nThe starred variables should infer to List nodes containing the appropriate elements, but they're not being inferred correctly.\n</issue>\n",
